## Recommendations
- **Before pushing:** `origin/feat/csv-total` holds three commits from an earlier, separate gate run that are not on the local branch, including a record at the same path, `.omp/team-config/evidence/gate/csv-total.json`. Pushing this branch will diverge from that history and conflict at that file. Decide which history to keep before you push.
- **Review worktree:** I did not create a separate one. The branch is already checked out in this clean checkout, and switching it falls under the git-consent rule, so all gate work ran here.
- **Left unstaged on purpose:** the uncited wave-1 captures (`q4`, `q6`) and the wave-1 trailer. The record doesn't cite them, so they are not committed.

